// The agent stream: the single contract between a prober-agent at a PoP and
// the prober-backend.
//
// The agent dials the backend and holds one long-lived bidirectional stream.
// Everything travels on it: the agent's Hello and heartbeats, the backend's
// jobs and cancellations, and the agent's job events. There is no other RPC.
//
// Jobs and events are oneofs on purpose. A browser-started trace, a scheduled
// monitor trace and a future SIP OPTIONS check are all "a job with a spec"
// and "events tagged by job id", so later probe kinds add oneof cases and
// change nothing else.

